<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "見えない光_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島の部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄入.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "650" "C" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Kogori-senpai<STYLE ID="1">: let me try sending her a message.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">She must be mentally worn out, and if this encourages her even a little.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">“</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and I said goodbye and I am home. When it looks like you can head home, please get in touch again.”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If it were possible, when </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> goes home, I would like to be the one to come for her.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is involved in the incident, going home is dangerous.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And at once a reply came.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="6">“Sorry about everything today. I'm waiting for </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">'s interview to be over.”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> is still at the police station. That must be the safest place of all.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But next door to </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">'s home is </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is involved in the incident, I absolutely must not let her near.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">“Thank you for your hard work. </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, won't you come to my place? Waiting on your own must be hard, right?”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="6">“Thank you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">. But it's all right. If I did that, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> would end up alone at home.”</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">True, the safety of </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Senpai's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> has to be secured as well.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But, how am I supposed to explain it?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> might be the culprit, so you must not go home? Something like that?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There is no way </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> would believe that. If I do not manage to keep </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> back somehow, there is no telling what will happen.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">“Then could you not have them let you stay at the police station? That way </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> would be with you too, right?”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1">, please notice somehow...!</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="6">“</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, you're kind. But, it seems the police have nowhere to put us up. And I have to get on with preparing </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">'s funeral. They say </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> can come home tomorrow morning, too.”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1">, no! You must not go home! I have to hold her back somehow.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">“</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, this is a strange thing to ask, but is your intuition for danger working?”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="6">“No, for now I'm fine. What's wrong, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">? You're acting strange?”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This is so frustrating! She might be in danger! What has happened to her usual intuition!?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯着信1.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Just then, a call came in on my smartphone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Kogori-senpai<STYLE ID="1">. It was from her.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hello!? </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="2">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oh, <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>... you seemed strange somehow, so I ended up calling."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1">'s voice was gentler than usual. Had she recovered a little of her composure?</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">No, more important than that right now: there is no telling when </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">her mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s questioning will end!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"S-</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="2">! I'm frightened! Right now, I'm all alone..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">On the spur of the moment I had blurted out something strange.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Trying somehow to make a situation where I could be together with </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">, I had come out with such a spoiled thing to say.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And now, when </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> is having such a hard time.</STYLE><PG>
"Hee, <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>, really. You are a cute junior after all. Come over to my place then, <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>. That way we can be together, can't we?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">True, that way we could be together, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> lives in the apartment next door.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Spending the night at Zahha would be impossible too, in </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">'s present situation.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Understood. I'm sorry. Please let me do that."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In that case, I will be the bodyguard.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I may not be much to rely on, but if I stay on guard at all times I can manage something.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If I keep watch without sleeping, we will surely make it to morning.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I will lock up perfectly, and whoever comes, I will absolutely not open the door.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No, first a thorough check of the inside of the apartment.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Someone may already be hiding there.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="2">, when can you leave? I'll come and meet you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"If it's just me, I can leave any time. It seems the police will drive <STYLE ID="8">Mom</STYLE> home."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Good, the sooner the better. Once we meet up, I will have </STYLE>Kogori-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> send </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> a false message saying she will be late.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The later it gets, the harder that trick becomes to use.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Then I'll come now. Please wait for me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄切.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Just in case, I will take something that could serve as a weapon.</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "11" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1,000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\tool-box1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\tool-box1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">A hammer... a kitchen knife... a frying pan...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A box cutter... a small saw... a wrench...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I could not find a weapon that looked as though it would be any use in my hands.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Well, it is far more reassuring than having none at all.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But, if a police officer on watch stopped me for questioning, I might be taken into custody for violating the Firearms and Swords Law.</STYLE> [TN: a Japanese law restricting the carrying of blades and firearms]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Well, I cannot afford to worry about that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I can say I am carrying it for self-defense, and in fact I am carrying it for self-defense.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">An excuse like that would never work, though.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">If I were stopped while walking home with </STYLE>Kogori-senpai<STYLE ID="1">, I alone might be taken to the police station.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If it came to that, I would only expose </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> to more danger.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">For now I will wrap the kitchen knife, the dangerous-looking one, in a towel and keep it inside my clothes.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Spreading the load out should fool the eye better.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Oh, and I have to put in a change of clothes.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And the charger for my smartphone. I will put these in my backpack and keep from standing out on the way.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島リュック大.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島リュック.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I tried looking at myself in the mirror with the backpack on.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It is a little big for me to be carrying...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But nothing smaller than this would hold it all.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If I am going by bicycle, it is probably all right.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door1_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家夜.gal" "WAIT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車開始.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車こぐ.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "800" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\道1夜ブラー.gal" "WAIT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I jumped onto my bicycle and headed for the police station.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I am moving this quickly. I should be the one to reach </STYLE>Kogori-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> first.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> may be lying in wait near the police station, though.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">No, that is not possible. If she were going to lie in wait, the apartment would be far more convenient in every way.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It is all right. My back is packed full of weapons.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Now then, the Operation begins.</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
